================================================================================
Methodology attribution
================================================================================

This project is an open-source adaptation of the methodology described in:

  Eide, Denise. *Uncovering the Logic of English: A Common-Sense Approach to
  Reading and Spelling.* 2nd ed. Logic of English, Inc., 2012.

The phonograms, spelling rules, and instructional routines in this curriculum
are derived from that book and from the Logic of English curriculum line.

OpenPhonograms is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Logic of
English, Inc. "Logic of English" and "Uncovering the Logic of English" are
trademarks of Logic of English, Inc.

If you want the full commercial curriculum (Foundations A-D, Essentials 1-2,
printed teacher's manuals, classroom kits, training, and ongoing product
support), please support the original authors:

  Book:    https://logicofenglish.com/
  Author:  Denise Eide
  Company: Logic of English, Inc.

