================================================================================
Generated content
================================================================================

The 248 lesson Markdown files, 178 worksheets, 25 decodable readers, and all
rendered PDFs are original prose generated by the project's Python toolchain
under the MIT License above. They are derivative works of the methodology
described in Eide 2012 but contain no verbatim prose from that book or from
any Logic of English commercial product.
